        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Ammunition</strong> any</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>First made to deal with a wicked necromancer's encroaching horde, gravebane ammunition is crafted with materials soaked in blessed waters. On a successful Strike, the attack deals an additional @Damage[1d10[vitality]] damage to creatures with void healing. If the target takes vitality damage, it must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:19] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 2} on a critical failure) until the start of your next turn.</p>"
